/K [4]
>>
endobj
320 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 738 0 R
/ActualText (Group related state into separate contexts instead of putting everything into one context. This allows for better performance and clearer separation of concerns.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
321 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 739 0 R
/ActualText (For example, create separate contexts for user data and theme settings.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
322 0 obj
<<
