/S /P
/P 740 0 R
/ActualText (3. Use Context Only for Shared State)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
323 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 741 0 R
/ActualText (Only use Context for state that is truly shared across multiple components. For state that only affects one or two components, use local component state \(useState or useReducer\).)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
